Homepage: https://github.com/ouch-org/ouch
Description: Compression and decompression utility
 Ouch compresses and decompresses files and directories in one command,
 for the formats tar, zip, 7z, gzip, snappy, zstd, xz, lzma, lzip, bzip2,
 bzip3, lz4, brotli and rar (decompression and listing only). It finds the
 format from the extension of the file.
 .
 This package holds ouch, built from the release @OUCH_VERSION@.
